Since the 0.2.0 release, the bundled native libraries are built from
https://github.com/tersePrompts/bashkit (branch `capi-host-mounts`), a fork of
Bashkit that adds host-directory mount exports (`bashkit_mount` /
`bashkit_unmount`, the `realfs-mounts` capability) and execution controls
(`bashkit_cancel` / `bashkit_clear_cancel`, the `BASHKIT_CANCELLED` status, the
`cancellation` capability) to the otherwise unchanged Bashkit C API. The
additions are MIT-licensed under the same terms as above, with copyright by the
Bashkit4j contributors, and are being contributed upstream.